.TH UWCC 1 "October 2026" "UWCC 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
uwcc \- local underwater video color correction
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B uwcc
.br
.B uwcc gui
.RI [ video ]
.br
.B uwcc
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
UWCC provides a desktop workspace and command-line tools for underwater video
color correction, presets, batch jobs, stabilization, and export.
Without a command, the desktop workspace opens.
Classical correction works without model weights or an AI runtime.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B gui
Open the desktop workspace, optionally opening a video.
.TP
.B probe
Print video metadata.
.TP
.B analyze
Analyze a video and save a project. An explicit input color profile is required.
.TP
.B render
Render a saved project to a video file.
.TP
.B batch
Analyze and render multiple videos.
.TP
.B relink
Relink a project to a source video, discarding stale analysis.
.TP
.B learn-reference
Learn a grade from an aligned corrected reference clip.
.TP
.B advise
Request optional cloud grading advice. Upload requires explicit opt-in and
provider credentials.
.TP
.B models
Show the model directory, discovered manifests, and inference runtime providers.
.PP
Use
.B uwcc COMMAND --help
for each command's arguments and options.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
Application data root. Defaults to ~/.local/share.
.TP
.B UWCC_MODEL_DIR
Override the model directory. Models are otherwise read from
$XDG_DATA_HOME/uwcc/models. The application does not download models automatically.
.TP
.B UWCC_INFERENCE_DEVICE
Set to cpu to force CPU inference; auto enables automatic provider selection.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/uwcc/
User data, recovery state, and optional models. Application removal preserves
this directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR ffprobe (1)
.PP
Project documentation: https://github.com/Schwaneberg/UnderwaterColorCorrection
